#ifdef PAM_AUTHENTICATION_MODULE
auth sufficient PAM_AUTHENTICATION_MODULE
#endif
auth required pam_unix.so

account required pam_nologin.so
account required pam_unix.so

XCOMM Not every system ships pam_lastlog: a missing module is not an error.
-session optional pam_lastlog.so

XCOMM The password section is used when the account check reports that the
XCOMM password has expired and the user sets a new one in the login screen.
password required pam_unix.so obscure
